@startuml
 title Local alpha LA1 - implemented ingestion ownership
 component "Web UI\nintent, decisions, progress" as Web
 component "HTTP\nauthentication, generated contracts" as HTTP
 component "Application ingestion coordinator\npolicy, authorization, recovery decisions" as App
 component "Domain modules + narrow shared libraries\nreadiness, parsing, identity, audio" as Domain
 component "Existing job host\nbounded execution, leases, cancellation" as Jobs
 component "Store adapters\nprivate intent and attempts" as State
 component "Existing archive publisher\nmasters, evidence, metadata, assets" as Archive
 component "Provider / encoder adapters\nnetwork and process mechanisms" as IO
 Web --> HTTP
 HTTP --> App
 App --> Domain
 App --> State
 App --> Jobs : durable intent / stable child identities
 Jobs --> App : execute authorized steps
 App --> Archive : existing effects
 App --> IO : existing ports
 note bottom of App
 No browser orchestration, generic DAG engine,
 duplicate importer or domain filesystem access.
 end note
@enduml
